<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ food price index rises 0.4 pct in Aug.</title>
<headline>NZ food price index rises 0.4 pct in Aug.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics New Zealand on Thursday released the following data for the Food Price Index for August:</p>
<p>    Aug 1996	   July 1996	    Aug 1995</p>
<p>    +0.4 pct	   +0.1 pct	     +0.2 pct</p>
<p>yr-end Aug 1996  yr-end July 1996  yr-end Aug 1995</p>
<p>    +2.4 pct	   +2.2 pct	     +0.7 pct</p>
<p>Note - The index makes up 18 percent of the consumer price index (CPI). Economists had forecast the index would rise 0.5 percent in August to give an annual rise of 2.5 percent.</p>
</text>
